      {
        \"output\": \"ready\",
        \"id\": \"geometry\",
        \"domain\": \"mechanical\",
        \"mode\": \"local\",
        \"check\": \"Decoded image is exactly 16x16 pixels with a single static frame (no horizontal strip, no extra canvas).\",
        \"basis\": \"Owner brief: 16x16 logical status cells and Ready is static. Consumer: succeeded maps to frames 1 and display.cell is [16,16].\",
